            "action_name": {
              "value": "Impersonate Shape"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, occult, polymorph, transmutation)\n\nThe noppera-bo grunt changes into a faceless version of a Small or Medium humanoid they've touched during the last 24 hours. While transformed and their face is covered, the grunt gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Impersonate that creature. The noppera-bo grunt can change back by using this ability again."
